+
+/* Linux tipd core.c: 0x20 SYSTEM_POWER_STATE, 0x3f POWER_STATUS.
+ * Do not confuse the system sleep state with measured VBUS voltage.
+ * Read status twice to reject an observed plug/role change. Sequential reads
